@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle uml2

package "Frontend (Browser Client)" {
    [HTML/CSS UI (Modern Glassmorphism)] as UI
    [JavaScript Controller (app.js)] as JSController
    [WebAssembly Module (Wasm)] as WASM
    [Pure JS Implementation] as JSImpl
    [Canvas API] as Canvas
}

package "Backend (PHP MVC Architecture)" {
    [Public Entry Point (index.php)] as Router
    [LogController] as Controller
    [LogModel] as Model
}

database "MySQL Database" {
    [performance_logs Table] as DB
}

UI <--> JSController : User Interactions & UI Updates
JSController --> Canvas : Get/Put Image Data
JSController --> WASM : Offload ArrayBuffer (via memory)
JSController --> JSImpl : Process Array directly
JSController --> Router : Fetch API (POST/GET logs)

Router --> Controller : Routes request
Controller --> Model : Calls data operations
Model --> DB : PDO SQL Queries
@enduml
